[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25141.75, "timestamp": "06:59:01", "text": "所以，这样做很好，我们可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25142.788, "timestamp": "06:59:02", "text": "把它做出来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25145.548, "timestamp": "06:59:05", "text": "是的，这样我就可以练习Aial了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25148.708, "timestamp": "06:59:08", "text": "甚至连阿斯拉也在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25151.03, "timestamp": "06:59:11", "text": "我在这里和阿斯拉战斗过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25153.07, "timestamp": "06:59:13", "text": "昨天我和你一样，从三月那里听到了消息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25155.27, "timestamp": "06:59:15", "text": "f asra 是怎么做到的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25158.708, "timestamp": "06:59:18", "text": "呃，他有再生能力，而我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25162.23, "timestamp": "06:59:22", "text": "我没有放弃，所以就像你知道的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25164.868, "timestamp": "06:59:24", "text": "好吧，所以他当时并没有快死，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25166.83, "timestamp": "06:59:26", "text": "三叉戟也给了我一些健康。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25168.43, "timestamp": "06:59:28", "text": "我当时也没快死，所以就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25169.91, "timestamp": "06:59:29", "text": "扔掉我的三叉戟逃跑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25173.548, "timestamp": "06:59:33", "text": "一会儿，然后又回来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25175.03, "timestamp": "06:59:35", "text": "他生气了，因为我有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25177.75, "timestamp": "06:59:37", "text": "你知道，就像一次又一次地撤退一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25181.51, "timestamp": "06:59:41", "text": "啊，你做到了，好吧，所以我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25184.11, "timestamp": "06:59:44", "text": "我做这件事让我很生气"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25187.43, "timestamp": "06:59:47", "text": "并且喜欢让他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25189.628, "timestamp": "06:59:49", "text": "他虽然神志不清，但你仍然可以杀了他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25192.868, "timestamp": "06:59:52", "text": "重点是，是的，但是你得到什么了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25195.628, "timestamp": "06:59:55", "text": "奖励？哦，对了，他确实给了我一个图腾。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25198.99, "timestamp": "06:59:58", "text": "意思是说他死了，所以他打爆了我的三个"}]